04, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NbK6Fd752YTCzdgzBK3P6H", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 6692, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MGFXgRNEsAuv5WHtqxCj8h", "tool": "create_branch", "args": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding", "from_ref": "main", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 6992, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MGFXgRNEsAuv5WHtqxCj8h", "tool": "create_branch", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 6992, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MGFXgRNEsAuv5WHtqxCj8h", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 10260, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Vs38oSpoxKTrknFH8PFPH2", "tool": "commit_changes", "args": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding", "message": "Use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) in round_money per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}], "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 10860, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Vs38oSpoxKTrknFH8PFPH2", "tool": "commit_changes", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10860, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Vs38oSpoxKTrknFH8PFPH2", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 12916, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01JMA3Zv5LS9tXvqYPSch3m4", "tool": "trigger_ci", "args": {"ref": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding", "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-fin-212-08d3cd5986", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 13216, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01JMA3Zv5LS9tXvqYPSch3m4", "tool": "trigger_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "ci-fix-fin-212-08d3cd5986", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 13216, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JMA3Zv5LS9tXvqYPSch3m4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 14994, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014DYSJQHC8M2QyHR9zNAkvT", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "args": {"run_id": "ci-0001", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 373216, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014DYSJQHC8M2QyHR9zNAkvT", "tool": "wait_for_ci", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 373216, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014DYSJQHC8M2QyHR9zNAkvT", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 378493, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01BCLD5gQ8vK8My2aeVToy2q", "tool": "open_pr", "args": {"head": "fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding", "base": "main", "title": "Fix round_money to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN) per FIN-212", "body": "## Summary\n`round_money` in `src/money.py` was documented as using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212) but actually used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. This caused `tests/test_money.py::test_half_even` to fail in the nightly build (e.g. `2.665` rounded to `2.67` instead of `2.66`).\n\n## Change\n- Switch `rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP` \u2192 `rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (and the import accordingly).\n\n## Testing\n- CI run `ci-0001` passed on commit `08d3cd5986`.\n\nNote: This changes rounding behavior for exact half-cent amounts where the preceding digit is even (they now round down instead of up). This matches the FIN-212 spec.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-fin-212-bankers-rounding", "confidence": 0.94}, "confidence": 0.94}, {"t_ms": 379393, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01BCLD5gQ8vK8My2aeVToy2q", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-fin-212-bankers-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 379393, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BCLD5gQ8vK8My2aeVToy2q", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 383383, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and the pull request is open with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` said it used banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212) but actually rounded half-cents up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`). So `2.665` became `2.67` instead of the expected `2.66`, and the test failed.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I changed it to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit (`08d3cd5986`).\n- **Pull request:** [#101](https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101) against `main`. The description notes that exact half-cent amounts after an even digit now round down instead of up, which is what FIN-212 requires.\n\nI didn't merge it. Merging into `main` needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by looking at the repository and the relevant files.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_018h7RNuQLhF8MWhKuKFxddv", "caller": {"ty